    "-70 dBm" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "/ 100" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "1%を超えると、ビデオ通話やゲームで途切れがはっきり分かります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Above 1%, dropouts become clearly noticeable in video calls and games."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10分" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10 min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10分ごとの件数" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Events per 10 minutes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1分ごと" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every minute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1分ごとの記録を時刻別にまとめた中央値。特定の時間帯だけ悪いなら回線側（ISPの輻輳）が疑われます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medians of the per-minute records, grouped by hour. If only certain hours are bad, suspect congestion at your ISP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1分ごとの集計・速度測定・負荷試験・機器一覧を削除します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deletes per-minute records, speed tests, load tests, and the device list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1時間" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 hour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2.4GHz は隣のチャンネルと電波が重なるため、1・6・11ch のどれかを選ぶのが基本です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On 2.4 GHz, neighboring channels overlap, so stick to channel 1, 6, or 11."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2.4GHz 帯で Bluetooth 機器と電波を分け合っている記録。多ければ 5GHz に寄せると改善することがあります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Records of sharing 2.4 GHz airtime with Bluetooth devices. If there are many, moving to 5 GHz may help."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "24時間" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "24 hours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
