    "2時間" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2 hours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30秒ごと" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every 30 seconds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5GHz の W53/W56 でこれが出るなら原因はほぼ確定。ルーターのチャンネルを W52（36/40/44/48ch）に固定すれば止まります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If this appears on a 5 GHz W53/W56 channel, it is almost certainly the cause. Fixing your router to W52 (channels 36/40/44/48) stops it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5秒ごとの中央値。間の幅が SN比で、広いほど余裕があります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Median every 5 seconds. The gap between the lines is the SNR — the wider, the better."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "60分" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
