    "locationd = 位置情報サービス、sharingd = AirDrop の相手探索。自作の監視ツールや system_profiler も原因になります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "locationd = Location Services, sharingd = AirDrop discovery. Monitoring tools and system_profiler can also trigger scans."
