    "mDNS 名" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mDNS Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS の統合ログから、切断・ローミング・スキャン・レーダー検出（DFS）・AWDL など、遅延スパイクの原因になりうる出来事を抜き出します。症状が出た直後に読むのが効果的です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Extracts events from the macOS unified log that can cause latency spikes — disconnects, roaming, scans, radar detection (DFS), and AWDL. Load it right after you notice a problem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS は位置情報の許可が無いアプリに SSID・BSSID・ビーコンの詳細を返しません。位置そのものは記録しません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS doesn’t give apps the SSID, BSSID, or beacon details without Location access. Your location itself is never recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 標準の networkQuality で測ります。回線を一時的に埋めるので、同居人がいれば一声かけてから。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uses macOS’s built-in networkQuality. It briefly saturates your connection, so let others on your network know first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
