    "回線が埋まった瞬間に、遅延が数百ms〜数秒に跳ね上がります。大きなダウンロード中に通話やゲームが止まるのはこれが原因です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the connection saturates, latency jumps to hundreds of milliseconds or several seconds. This is why calls and games freeze during large downloads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回線が混むと、リアルタイムの通信がまともに成立しない水準です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the connection is busy, real-time communication barely works."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回線をわざと埋めて、そのとき遅延がどこまで跳ねるかを測ります（バッファブロート）。大きなダウンロード中に通話やゲームが止まる原因を直接確かめる試験です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deliberately saturates your connection and measures how far latency rises (bufferbloat). It directly checks why calls and games freeze during large downloads."
